body:
`formatValue` renders both `null` and `undefined` as the string `undefined`. That changes semantics when exporting definitions (a `null` will round-trip back as missing/undefined). Consider rendering `null` as `null` and only using `undefined` for actual `undefined` values.
```suggestion
  if (value === undefined) return 'undefined';
  if (value === null) return 'null';
```
